  <item>
    <title>ep2. 你与自然有怎样的连结？｜我种的植物在守护我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6616233148c40e2fb060dbe6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6616233148c40e2fb060dbe6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 10 Apr 2024 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>这里是周三故事，我们在记录每一个想要被记录的人生故事。</span></h2><span></span><p><span>我们记录的第二个故事出炉啦。本期故事的讲述者叫Vanto。经过专业塔罗占卜师分析，在Vanto的精心照料下，她养的植物已经成了精，正在默默守护她！是怎样的养护让Vanto和她植物产生了如此深厚的连结？ Vanto向我们讲述了她养植物的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：60km/h - 晨曦光廊</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Vanto家的植物照片展</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu_Jdw1XKzMAGQd8zONSCy-X2p4h.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>刚开始养的袖珍椰子和鹅掌藤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lokerHy8phX1m0S1EB3-aSTA-xhs.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>封城时期的鹅掌藤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr1N0XU3b6KULfmNoVQHNzvZZksa.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>水培白萝卜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqU0Xa6N-W9GRNMU7DblUd1Euj3Y.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>水培白菜和袖珍椰子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvVmf7Yf-KkoqrM2HJPGvqeJbSky.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>水培葱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoEACnIOZozrHAMOErLDUVH7TGNq.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>一直在默默长小芋头的孔雀竹芋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlG6PHmnVyprYXfMuQYg0eYq3Y_b.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>开始长叶的红薯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuTRcEpIfPdQMwY-mU0ojDl_jRmj.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>在插画前茁壮成长的红薯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtGzBJUP769aMlChSS9DGV7akd3K.pic"></figure><span></span><p><span>把自然损耗的飞机蔓绿绒尝试做成标本</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnOJC10t8cQa8QlFL0D_E2h3FiUJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>给飞机蔓绿绒量叶片大小</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lu6o9n8F62D_0Ed5iU21u2j2xEbB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>给花烛量叶片大小</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhQKeys0jkyAASLGj71ShZCo-Uw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>黑天鹅海芋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmn0HcZ6d0UWAJLharABUW1VUCSZ.pic"></figure><span></span><p><span>接受闷养处理后，叶片逐渐展开的黑天鹅海芋</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAJ4TIgjJJZcZW2WsmcTN_X38Xw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>接受第二轮拯救的黑天鹅海芋，长出了一些气生根？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoIWmzDlyo0B8wxgaSZWCZuh-qpB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>薄荷、迷迭香和罗勒都死了，剪下了最后的迷迭香当香薰</span></p><span></span><p><span>（植物照片均由Vanto提供）</span></p><span></span><p><span>* * *</span></p><span></span><p><span>讲述者：Vanto</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：阿井</span></p><span></span><p><span>记录者：阿井</span></p><span></span><p><span>* * *</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：aj__1009</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：周三故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：请添加微信（备注：听友群）</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待听到你的故事，欢迎与我们联系～</span></p>]]></description>
